From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: macbox <macbox@localhost>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 01:07:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 52/92] diagnostic: compute census in the pass timer

A dispatch's unit notes the compute pipeline last bound on the thread and its group counts;
compute pipelines made write a census line (entry, module) and modules their SPIR-V, while the
pass timer is on.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 crates/metal2vulkan-runtime/src/pass_times.rs | 44 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../src/pipeline/objects.rs                   |  8 ++++
 2 files changed, 50 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/crates/metal2vulkan-runtime/src/pass_times.rs b/crates/metal2vulkan-runtime/src/pass_times.rs
index 933b7d8a..3bc09c55 100644
--- a/crates/metal2vulkan-runtime/src/pass_times.rs
